{"lines": ["How is Cleopatra connected to Hello Kitty?", "Around sixteen thirty-seven, Pietro da Cortona painted Julius Caesar giving Cleopatra the throne of Egypt.", "Caesar's heir Augustus became Rome's first emperor, and his dynasty ended with Nero.", "Around fourteen eighty-two, Filippino Lippi painted Nero putting the apostle Peter, the first pope, on trial.", "From Peter, the line of popes runs unbroken to the 266th, Pope Francis.", "In twenty seventeen, President Donald Trump visited Pope Francis at the Vatican.", "In twenty nineteen, Japan's prime minister Shinzo Abe took a golf selfie with Trump near Tokyo.", "And three months later, Hello Kitty joined Abe on stage at a summit reception in Yokohama.", "How is Magnus Carlsen connected to Bill Cipher?", "In twenty fourteen, Magnus Carlsen lifted the world chess trophy in Sochi while Vladimir Putin applauded beside him.", "In twenty fifteen, Putin met Barack Obama at the United Nations in New York.", "In twenty sixteen, Obama and Michelle joined Jon Stewart at a comedy show for troops near Washington.", "That same night, Stewart took a bow on stage with comedian Kristen Schaal.", "In twenty fourteen, Schaal, the voice of Mabel, posed with Gravity Falls creator Alex Hirsch in Los Angeles.", "And Hirsch created Bill Cipher and voices him himself.", "How is Julius Caesar connected to Sonic the Hedgehog?", "Julius Caesar's heir Augustus became Rome's first emperor, and the dynasty ran four more emperors to Nero.", "In twenty twenty-four, Pope Francis invited over a hundred comedians to the Vatican, and shook hands with Jimmy Fallon.", "Two months later, Fallon welcomed actor Ben Schwartz onto The Tonight Show.", "And since twenty twenty, Ben Schwartz has been the voice of Sonic in the Sonic the Hedgehog movies.", "How is Kim Jong Un connected to King Henry the Eighth?", "In twenty nineteen, Kim Jong Un shook Donald Trump's hand at the Korean border.", "Weeks earlier, Trump marked D-Day's 75th anniversary beside Queen Elizabeth the Second.", "Elizabeth sat on the throne of Henry the Eighth, handed down through four centuries of kings and queens.", "How is Fidel Castro connected to Patrick Star?", "In twenty fourteen, Mexican president Enrique Pe\u00f1a Nieto visited Fidel Castro in Havana.", "In twenty sixteen, Vice President Joe Biden flew to Mexico City for talks with Pe\u00f1a Nieto.", "In twenty twenty-four, Star Wars legend Mark Hamill visited President Biden in the Oval Office.", "In twenty twenty-five, Hamill joined the SpongeBob cast, including Bill Fagerbakke, at a Hollywood handprint ceremony.", "And Bill Fagerbakke has been the voice of Patrick Star since nineteen ninety-nine."], "heard": [["How", 0.0, 0.26], ["is", 0.26, 0.4], ["Cleopatra", 0.4, 1.06], ["connected", 1.06, 1.52], ["to", 1.52, 1.84], ["Hello", 1.84, 2.14], ["Kitty?", 2.14, 2.44], ["Around", 3.56, 3.68], ["1637,", 3.68, 4.64], ["Pietro", 4.98, 5.36], ["de", 5.36, 5.5], ["Cortona", 5.5, 6.02], ["painted", 6.02, 6.34], ["Julius", 6.34, 6.72], ["Caesar", 6.72, 7.12], ["giving", 7.12, 7.48], ["Cleopatra", 7.48, 8.32], ["the", 8.32, 8.54], ["throne", 8.54, 8.8], ["of", 8.8, 8.96], ["Egypt.", 8.96, 9.2], ["Caesar's", 9.92, 10.44], ["heir,", 10.44, 10.6], ["Augustus,", 10.76, 11.04], ["became", 11.56, 11.74], ["Rome's", 11.74, 12.22], ["first", 12.22, 12.48], ["emperor,", 12.48, 12.7], ["and", 13.12, 13.18], ["his", 13.18, 13.28], ["dynasty", 13.28, 13.58], ["ended", 13.58, 14.04], ["with", 14.04, 14.36], ["Nero.", 14.36, 14.56], ["Around", 15.68, 15.82], ["1482,", 15.82, 16.5], ["Filipino", 16.92, 17.24], ["lippy", 17.24, 17.76], ["painted", 17.76, 18.14], ["Nero", 18.14, 18.42], ["putting", 18.42, 18.82], ["the", 18.82, 19.02], ["apostle", 19.02, 19.26], ["Peter,", 19.26, 19.7], ["the", 20.04, 20.1], ["first", 20.1, 20.26], ["pope,", 20.26, 20.46], ["on", 20.74, 20.82], ["trial.", 20.82, 21.1], ["From", 22.12, 22.26], ["Peter,", 22.26, 22.52], ["the", 22.82, 22.94], ["line", 22.94, 23.12], ["of", 23.12, 2